        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/2340b0d2/models/2026-delphi10000-echinarachnius-parma-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L54-L58> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-echinarachnius-parma-turing-wavelength-s0-repro-package-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
